术家为属主的 ARTIST_APPEARS。查询写出来是这样：
![PPT 第 25 页](slides/page-37.png)

![PPT 第 25 页](slides/page-38.png)


```text
PROCEDURE GET_ARTISTS_FOR_ALBUM;
BEGIN
  /* Declare variables */
  DECLARE ARTIST_RECORD ARTIST;
  DECLARE APPEARS_RECORD APPEARS;
  DECLARE ALBUM_RECORD ALBUM;

  /* Start navigation */
  FIND ALBUM USING ALBUM.NAME = "Mooshoo Tribute"
    ON ERROR DISPLAY "Album not found" AND EXIT;

  /* For each appearance on the album */
  FIND FIRST APPEARS WITHIN APPEARS_ALBUM OF ALBUM_RECORD
    ON ERROR DISPLAY "No artists found for this album" AND EXIT;

ITHIN APPEARS_ALBUM OF ALBUM_RECORD
    ON ERROR DISPLAY "No artists found for this album" AND EXIT;

  /* Loop through the set of APPEARS */
  REPEAT
    /* Navigate to the corresponding artist */
    FIND OWNER WITHIN ARTIST_APPEARS OF APPEARS_RECORD
      ON ERROR DISPLAY "Error finding artist";
    /* Display artist name */
    DISPLAY ARTIST_RECORD.NAME;
    /* Move to the next APPEARS record in the set */
    FIND NEXT APPEARS WITHIN APPEARS_ALBUM OF ALBUM_RECORD
      ON ERROR EXIT;
  END REPEAT;
END PROCEDURE;
```

这段代码描述的是一条导航路线：

每个成员记录里存着指向下一个成员、上一个成员和属主的指针（见 PPT 第 26 页右侧的示意图，那是一条首尾相接的环形链）。把环形链简化成以 `NULL` 结尾的单链表，上面的查询翻译成 C 大致是：

```c
/* Walk the APPEARS set owned by the album, then jump to each member's owner artist */
for (struct appears *p = album->first_appears; p != NULL; p = p->next_in_album)
    printf("%s\n", p->artist->name);
```

这段代码的要害在于它把执行计划写死了。它选择从专辑出发去找艺术家；另一种写法是遍历所有艺术家，逐个检查他们的 APPEARS 集合里有没有这张专辑。哪一种更快，取决于艺术家有多少、专辑有多少、按名字找一张专辑有没有捷径，而这些条件今天是一个样子，一年以后可能完全不同。程序员写代码时依据的是当时的数据，数据变了，查询要么变慢，要么在存储结构调整之后直接失效，只能重写。

